  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/416d9f770bfcfb3187b7e83161c842f20cb2ceb2</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/DerDemystifier/SmarterTypeField/commit/416d9f770bfcfb3187b7e83161c842f20cb2ceb2"/>
    <title>
        feat: add ignore_extra_words option for substring matching (#10)
    </title>
    <updated>2026-02-24T01:29:46Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6194359?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>lgallard</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/lgallard</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat: add ignore_extra_words option for substring matching (#10)

* feat: add ignore_extra_words option for substring matching

When enabled, accepts the typed answer as correct if it contains the
expected answer as a substring. This is particularly useful for Anki
cloze deletion cards where users may type the full sentence instead
of just the hidden phrase.

The check respects the existing ignore_case and ignore_accents settings
for consistent normalisation before the substring comparison.

* feat: add Ignore Extra Words checkbox to config GUI

* docs: add config GUI screenshot for ignore_extra_words option&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
